        \u0275\u0275elementStart(179, "p");
        \u0275\u0275text(180, "Bullhorn is continually seeking to update and innovate our products, and leverage the latest features in the frameworks we use. In support of that mission, we are updating our Novo UI and its supporting novo-elements library to Angular 13. This update allows us to continue offering a streamlined and consistent experience across Bullhorn\u2019s complete product portfolio. This update includes both an Angular upgrade, as well as supporting the latest Typescript updates. You can find more details in the Technical Release Notes section below.");
